DESC: In a flash of recognition, you learn about the geography of your surroundings within a radius of (max(1,floor(CASTERLEVEL/2))) miles. This instant familiarity grants you a +(min(5,CASTERLEVEL)) insight bonus on Knowledge (geography) checks and Survival checks to avoid getting lost so long as you remain in the affected area. Additionally, for the duration of the spell you can make Knowledge (geography) checks regarding the affected area as though you were trained in that skill.
DESC 2:  In a flash of recognition, you learn about the geography of your surroundings within a radius of 2 miles. This instant familiarity grants you a +5 insight bonus on Knowledge [geography] checks and Survival checks to avoid getting lost so long as you remain in the affected area. Additionally, for the duration of the spell you can make Knowledge [geography] checks regarding the affected area as though you were trained in that skill.
